."}, "file_path": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "(Optional) The path to an input csv file."}}, "required": ["message"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"description": "Analyse a plot using GPT-4o.", "name": "analyse_plot", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"message": {"type": "string", "description": "The request of analysing a plot. e.g. 'what plant yields the most leaves at the end of the experiment?'"}, "file_path": {"type": "string", "description": "The path of the plot to be analysed, including the suffix."}}, "required": ["message", "file_path"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"description": "Compute statistics or new values from a CSV file. Optionally, it saves the results to a new file.", "name": "compute_from_csv", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"message": {"type": "string", "description": "The request of computing from a CSV file. Example: 'Compute the average of A for B on C.'"}, "file_path": {"type": "string", "description": "The path of the CSV file to be analysed."}, "save_path": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "save_path"}}, "required": ["message", "file_path"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"description": "Ask a question to a CSV file such as which image has the most leaf count. It does not generate a new file.", "name": "query_csv", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"message": {"type": "string", "description": "Asking questions to a CSV file. Example: 'What is the maximum number of column A?'"}, "file_path": {"type": "string", "description": "The path of the CSV file to be analysed."}}, "required": ["message", "file_path"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"description": "Plot data from a CSV file. Be sure to provide details of requirements and the path to save the plot.", "name": "plot_from_csv", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"message": {"type": "string", "descript